1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,550
Video ya leo ni kuhusu nini? Kila mtu anapenda!! Likizo ya Majira ya Joto!

2
00:00:08,550 --> 00:00:17,129
Katika sehemu fulani ya video, utauliza swali kwa Kijapani. Ukisikia, tafadhali uandike maoni.

3
00:00:17,879 --> 00:00:20,879
Sehemu ya 1: Asubuhi ya Mazoezi ya Redio

4
00:00:20,879 --> 00:00:23,879
Ndugu yangu, amka.

5
00:00:23,901 --> 00:00:24,325
Saa kumi na moja na nusu za asubuhi tayari.

6
00:00:24,325 --> 00:00:27,691
Bado ninahisi usingizi.

7
00:00:27,714 --> 00:00:32,848
Ndugu yangu, kwa nini tunamka mapema hivi wakati wa likizo ya majira ya joto?

8
00:00:32,871 --> 00:00:36,837
Leo mazoezi ya redio yanaanza asubuhi hii.

9
00:00:36,860 --> 00:00:38,759
Tutachelewa.

10
00:00:38,783 --> 00:00:42,063
Mazoezi ya redio, eh?

11
00:00:42,087 --> 00:00:44,544
Inanikumbusha zamani.

12
00:00:44,567 --> 00:00:47,850
Lakini mimi siendi.

13
00:00:47,874 --> 00:00:52,907
Haitakiwi. Tulikubaliana tutaenda pamoja, usisahau?

14
00:00:52,930 --> 00:00:55,963
Tulikubaliana?

15
00:00:55,986 --> 00:00:59,031
Niruhusu kulala kwa dakika kumi zaidi.

16
00:00:59,055 --> 00:01:04,222
Amka! Tunahitaji kupata kadi ya stampu.

17
00:01:04,245 --> 00:01:06,778
Kadi ya stampu?

18
00:01:06,801 --> 00:01:11,297
Kama tutakusanya nyingi, tutapata jambo zuri?

19
00:01:11,321 --> 00:01:15,860
Siku ya mwisho, tutapata vitafunio na daftari.

20
00:01:15,884 --> 00:01:19,292
Haya, hiyo ni nzuri.

21
00:01:19,316 --> 00:01:22,749
Kama wakati tulipo watoto.

22
00:01:22,772 --> 00:01:26,189
Kwa hivyo, tayari haraka.

23
00:01:26,212 --> 00:01:29,857
Tunahitaji dakika kumi kutembea hadi bustani.

24
00:01:29,881 --> 00:01:32,548
Sawa, sawa.

25
00:01:32,571 --> 00:01:35,051
Nitamka sasa.

26
00:01:35,074 --> 00:01:37,749
Nenda na osha uso wako upesi.

27
00:01:37,772 --> 00:01:41,351
Mimi nitavaa viatu na kukusubiria.

28
00:01:41,374 --> 00:01:44,426
Je, nje ni joto?

29
00:01:44,449 --> 00:01:46,116
Hapana.

30
00:01:46,139 --> 00:01:49,972
Asubuhi kuna upepo na kidogo baridi.

31
00:01:49,995 --> 00:01:52,029
Ina hisi nzuri.

32
00:01:52,052 --> 00:01:55,525
Basi, haraka kidogo.

33
00:01:55,548 --> 00:02:00,127
Je, bado unakumbuka muziki wa mazoezi ya redio?

34
00:02:00,151 --> 00:02:04,249
Mimi nilisoma shuleni, basi sina wasiwasi.

35
00:02:04,272 --> 00:02:07,039
Nitakufundisha ndugu yangu.

36
00:02:07,062 --> 00:02:08,434
Asante.

37
00:02:08,457 --> 00:02:12,024
Sawa, nimejiandaa, twende.

38
00:02:12,047 --> 00:02:15,880
Usisahau kadi ya stampu.

39
00:02:15,903 --> 00:02:18,115
Aha, karibu sana.

40
00:02:18,139 --> 00:02:20,739
Niliiweka mezani.

41
00:02:20,762 --> 00:02:23,729
Twende sasa.

42
00:02:23,752 --> 00:02:30,857
Kiungo cha tovuti ambapo unaweza kukagua video ya leo kipo kwenye maelezo na maoni ya juu. *Tovuti inaweza kufutwa bila tahadhari.

43
00:02:30,857 --> 00:02:33,857
Sehemu ya 2: Ufunguzi wa Bwawa la Majira ya Joto na Bafu ya Maji Baridi ya Kutisha

44
00:02:33,857 --> 00:02:37,890
Je, tutaenda bwawa la shule leo mchana?

45
00:02:37,913 --> 00:02:39,720
Sawa.

46
00:02:39,743 --> 00:02:43,635
Ufunguzi wa bwawa wakati wa likizo ya majira ya joto unaanza leo, ndio?

47
00:02:43,659 --> 00:02:44,938
Ndiyo.

48
00:02:44,961 --> 00:02:51,194
Inaanza saa saba, basi tutaonana kwenye lango la shule saa sita na nusu.

49
00:02:51,217 --> 00:02:52,584
Sawa.

50
00:02:52,607 --> 00:02:57,426
Lakini, bafu ya kwanza ya maji ni baridi mno, si ndio?

51
00:02:57,449 --> 00:03:01,683
Eeh, huitwa kwa jina la 'dushi ya maji ya jehanamu'.

52
00:03:01,706 --> 00:03:05,590
Hiyo ni baridi mno na sipendi kabisa.

53
00:03:05,613 --> 00:03:09,946
Lazima niingie kwa ajili ya kusafisha.

54
00:03:09,969 --> 00:03:12,703
Umechukua kofia na goggles?

55
00:03:12,726 --> 00:03:14,165
Ndiyo.

56
00:03:14,188 --> 00:03:16,189
Nimeziweka kwenye mfuko wangu.

57
00:03:16,212 --> 00:03:18,546
Taulo nimeshatayarisha.

58
00:03:18,569 --> 00:03:22,702
Hali ya hewa ni nzuri, maji yataonekana ya kupendeza.

59
00:03:22,725 --> 00:03:28,202
Jana kulikuwa na mvua, nilihofia leo haituruhusu kuingia.

60
00:03:28,226 --> 00:03:33,159
Leo joto sana, hakika tutaweza kuingia.

61
00:03:33,182 --> 00:03:37,790
Baada ya bwawa, ningependa kula kitu baridi kidogo.

62
00:03:37,813 --> 00:03:42,854
Tununue aiskrimu dukani karibu na shule tukila.

63
00:03:42,877 --> 00:03:45,044
Hiyo ni bora kabisa.

64
00:03:45,067 --> 00:03:47,700
Twende na pesa za mfukoni.

65
00:03:47,723 --> 00:03:52,157
Je, katika bwawa lazima tuswime kimya?

66
00:03:52,180 --> 00:03:57,659
Walimu wako wanaangalia sana, kama utasonga mno utapata matatizo.

67
00:03:57,683 --> 00:03:59,749
Nitakuwa makini.

68
00:03:59,772 --> 00:04:02,047
Tutaonana baadaye.

69
00:04:02,071 --> 00:04:03,304
Ndiyo.

70
00:04:03,327 --> 00:04:06,094
Saa sita na nusu mbele ya lango.

71
00:04:06,117 --> 00:04:08,093
Usichelewe.

72
00:04:08,117 --> 00:04:09,450
Hakuna matata.

73
00:04:09,473 --> 00:04:12,141
Nitaruka kwa baiskeli ili nipate kuwasili kwa wakati.

74
00:04:12,164 --> 00:04:21,846
Kama umeelewa, tafadhali ujibu kwa comment.

75
00:04:21,846 --> 00:04:24,846
Sehemu ya 3: Mzunguko wa Sikukuu ya Obon / Changamoto za Safari wakati wa Sikukuu ya Obon

76
00:04:24,846 --> 00:04:29,126
Wiki ijayo itakuwa sikukuu ya Obon.

77
00:04:29,149 --> 00:04:33,149
Unakwenda mahali popote, mkuu?

78
00:04:33,172 --> 00:04:38,442
Mimi nina mpango wa kurudi nyumbani.

79
00:04:38,466 --> 00:04:41,899
Nimehifadhi tiketi ya Shinkansen.

80
00:04:41,922 --> 00:04:43,927
Nzuri sana.

81
00:04:43,951 --> 00:04:49,040
Je, tiketi za Shinkansen zilikuwa rahisi kupata?

82
00:04:49,063 --> 00:04:52,230
Hapana, kamwe.

83
00:04:52,253 --> 00:04:57,292
Wakati wa Obon ni vigumu mno.

84
00:04:57,315 --> 00:05:05,515
Niliona kwenye habari kwamba asilimia ya abiria huwa mara mbili ya uwezo wa treni.

85
00:05:05,538 --> 00:05:07,538
Ndiyo hivi.

86
00:05:07,561 --> 00:05:13,830
Magari ya bila kukubaliwa huwa na watu wengi mno hata huwezi kujongea.

87
00:05:13,854 --> 00:05:20,254
Sijawahi kufanya safari ya Obon huko Japani.

88
00:05:20,277 --> 00:05:28,844
Barabara kuu pia huwa na magari yanayoshikamana kwa kilomita 40, hivyo kurudi kwa gari ni changamoto.

89
00:05:28,867 --> 00:05:32,004
Hiyo ni nzito sana.

90
00:05:32,027 --> 00:05:37,294
Kwa nini watu wote wanarudi nyumbani wakati mmoja?

91
00:05:37,317 --> 00:05:41,884
Kwa sababu kampuni zinaacha watu wote likizo wakati mmoja.

92
00:05:41,907 --> 00:05:45,281
Hakuna cha kufanya kuhusu hilo.

93
00:05:45,304 --> 00:05:50,471
Unapofika nyumbani, unafanya nini na familia?

94
00:05:50,494 --> 00:05:56,974
Nitakwenda kuzuru makaburi na kula chakula na marafiki wa eneo hilo.

95
00:05:56,998 --> 00:05:59,464
Inaonekana ya kupendeza.

96
00:05:59,487 --> 00:06:04,130
Lazima ninunue zawadi nyingi.

97
00:06:04,154 --> 00:06:08,609
Nina mpango wa kununua biskuti maarufu za Tokyo.

98
00:06:08,632 --> 00:06:14,565
Wazazi wako wa vijijini wanataraji kukutana nawe.

99
00:06:14,588 --> 00:06:17,022
Ningependa iwe hivyo.

100
00:06:17,045 --> 00:06:21,078
Wewe utakuwa na likizo ya majira ya joto, unafanya nini?

101
00:06:21,101 --> 00:06:26,999
Mimi sitakwenda popote, nitaketi Tokyo nikapumzika tu.

102
00:06:27,022 --> 00:06:30,194
Hiyo pia ni nzuri.

103
00:06:30,217 --> 00:06:35,217
Mji wa Tokyo wakati wa Obon watu ni wachache na ni utulivu.

104
00:06:35,240 --> 00:06:37,490
Kweli?

105
00:06:37,514 --> 00:06:42,181
Basi, twende tukale kitu kitamu.

106
00:06:42,204 --> 00:06:44,237
Sawa.

107
00:06:44,260 --> 00:06:48,994
Baada ya likizo, tutaongea kuhusu zawadi.

108
00:06:49,017 --> 00:06:52,017
Jihadhari katika maisha yako.

109
00:06:52,040 --> 00:06:55,040
Mandhari 4: Majira ya Kiangazi Barani na Maisha ya Bila Mtandao / Majira ya Kiangazi Barani: Tikiti Maji na Maisha ya Bila Mtandao

110
00:06:55,040 --> 00:07:00,573
Nyumbani kwa babu yangu barani, kweli ni utulivu sana.

111
00:07:00,596 --> 00:07:03,974
Sauti ya zile zile za upepo tu zinazosikika.

112
00:07:03,997 --> 00:07:06,630
Mara kwa mara hivi vipo vizuri.

113
00:07:06,653 --> 00:07:11,231
Lakini, sinyali ya Wi-Fi haifikii kabisa hapa.

114
00:07:11,255 --> 00:07:14,588
Hawezi kutazama video kwenye simu yangu.

115
00:07:14,611 --> 00:07:17,545
Kwa sababu tuko karibu na milima.

116
00:07:17,568 --> 00:07:22,034
Mara kwa mara jiongeze mtandao kidogo na utulize.

117
00:07:22,057 --> 00:07:26,191
Kuna mambo mengi mno ya kufanya, naona ninaacha muda.

118
00:07:26,214 --> 00:07:29,419
Liko lazima niketi tu kwenye tatami na kutambaa.

119
00:07:29,442 --> 00:07:33,809
Basi, kula tikiti maji ambayo bibi ameikata.

120
00:07:33,832 --> 00:07:36,724
Aa, inaonekana tamu.

121
00:07:36,747 --> 00:07:39,481
Ni baridi na tamu.

122
00:07:39,504 --> 00:07:45,537
Kula tikiti maji kwenye ua wakati wa kiangazi, hii ndiyo hisia ya majira ya kiangazi ya Japani, sivyo?

123
00:07:45,560 --> 00:07:47,216
Ndiyo.

124
00:07:47,239 --> 00:07:50,696
Ee, hiyo moshi inayotoka kwenye bustani ni nini?

125
00:07:50,720 --> 00:07:55,120
Aa, hiyo ni uvutaji wa mbu.

126
00:07:55,143 --> 00:07:57,676
Tunauweka ili mbu wasiweze kuja.

127
00:07:57,699 --> 00:08:00,666
Ina harufu ya kipekee.

128
00:08:00,689 --> 00:08:04,422
Lakini, ina harufu inayofanya niwe na utulivu.

129
00:08:04,445 --> 00:08:09,378
Jioni tutaenda kucheza karibu na mto.

130
00:08:09,401 --> 00:08:10,368
Mto?

131
00:08:10,391 --> 00:08:12,484
Unaweza kuogelea?

132
00:08:12,507 --> 00:08:14,507
Ndio, unaweza kuogelea.

133
00:08:14,531 --> 00:08:19,331
Maji yake ni safi sana, baridi na inafurahisha.

134
00:08:19,354 --> 00:08:20,958
Ninataka kwenda.

135
00:08:20,981 --> 00:08:23,181
Kuna samaki?

136
00:08:23,204 --> 00:08:26,470
Kuna samaki wadogo wengi.

137
00:08:26,493 --> 00:08:29,633
Kama utaweza bahati nzuri, unaweza kukamata.

138
00:08:29,657 --> 00:08:31,390
Ninangojea kwa hamu.

139
00:08:31,413 --> 00:08:36,746
Nilifikiri maisha barani ni ya kuacha muda, lakini kuna mambo mengi ya kufurahisha pia.

140
00:08:36,769 --> 00:08:38,742
Ndio.

141
00:08:38,766 --> 00:08:44,017
Usiku nyota huonekana vizuri sana, hivyo ngoja ufurahie hiyo pia.

142
00:08:44,040 --> 00:08:49,933
Tokyo nyota haziwezi kuonekana vizuri, naomba usiku uje upesi.

143
00:08:49,957 --> 00:08:54,490
Basi, kwa sasa nitaenda kulala kidogo mchana.

144
00:08:54,513 --> 00:08:57,513
Mandhari 5: Maandalizi ya Kambi ya Majira ya Kiangazi ya Tenisi na Wasiwasi / Maandalizi ya Kambi ya Majira ya Kiangazi ya Tenisi na Wasiwasi

145
00:08:57,513 --> 00:09:02,970
Wiki ijayo kambi ya majira ya kiangazi ya klabu ya tenisi itaanza.

146
00:09:02,994 --> 00:09:07,483
Aa, kufikiria tu kuniumiza.

147
00:09:07,506 --> 00:09:11,772
Kila siku kutoka asubuhi hadi jioni tutaendelea mazoezi.

148
00:09:11,795 --> 00:09:17,040
Kambi ya mwaka huu itafanyika kwenye kiwanja cha tenisi kwenye mlima, sivyo?

149
00:09:17,064 --> 00:09:24,339
Ndio, ningependa iwe baridi kidogo, lakini kiwanja cha tenisi ni joto.

150
00:09:24,362 --> 00:09:30,538
Nimesikia kuwa wakubwa wanakuwa wakali mno wakati wa kambi.

151
00:09:30,561 --> 00:09:33,129
Kweli kabisa.

152
00:09:33,153 --> 00:09:38,886
Mikutano ya usiku ni ndefu na muda wa uhuru haupatikani kabisa.

153
00:09:38,909 --> 00:09:42,243
Umekwisha tayari kupanga mizigo yako?

154
00:09:42,266 --> 00:09:43,799
Ndiyo.

155
00:09:43,822 --> 00:09:49,028
Ndiyo. Nimejaza mpira wa raketi vitatu na nguo nyingi za mazoezi kwenye mfuko.

156
00:09:49,051 --> 00:09:56,334
Ninahangaika kwa hali ya joto kali, kwa hiyo nitabeba vipande vingi vya vinywaji vya michezo.

157
00:09:56,358 --> 00:09:59,396
Hiyo ni nzuri.

158
00:09:59,419 --> 00:10:05,490
Wakati wa mazoezi, ni lazima ule maji mengi sana, la sivyo ni hatari.

159
00:10:05,514 --> 00:10:08,114
Chakula kitakuwa kitamu?

160
00:10:08,137 --> 00:10:12,403
Chakula cha nyumba ya kulala kinaonekana kuwa na kiasi kikubwa.

161
00:10:12,426 --> 00:10:15,840
Lazima ule kwa wingi ili uwe na nguvu.

162
00:10:15,864 --> 00:10:22,712
Mazoezi ni magumu, lakini kulala pamoja na wenzangu usiku kunaonekana kuwa ya furaha.

163
00:10:22,736 --> 00:10:27,190
Hmm, nafikiri nitalala mara moja kwa sababu ya uchovu.

164
00:10:27,213 --> 00:10:30,379
Kweli.

165
00:10:30,402 --> 00:10:35,402
Kweli. Lakini baada ya mazoezi, tutakuwa wamejifunza zaidi.

166
00:10:35,425 --> 00:10:38,859
Lazima tuamini na kujitahidi.

167
00:10:38,882 --> 00:10:41,523
Nataka kushinda mechi.

168
00:10:41,546 --> 00:10:43,146
Ndiyo.

169
00:10:43,170 --> 00:10:46,903
Tujitahidi pamoja kuvuka mazoezi magumu.

170
00:10:46,926 --> 00:10:50,404
Sawa, tuingize nguvu.

171
00:10:50,428 --> 00:10:54,561
Kwanza, ni muhimu tuangalie ili tusisahau chochote.

172
00:10:54,584 --> 00:10:57,799
Usisahau kremu ya kujikinga na jua.

173
00:10:57,823 --> 00:11:00,423
Aa, nimesahau.

174
00:11:00,446 --> 00:11:03,025
Asante kwa kunikumbusha.

175
00:11:03,049 --> 00:11:06,049
Sehemu ya 6: Vita vya Mtihani wakati wa likizo ya joto / Mapambano ya Majira ya Joto: Dhoruba ya Mtihani

176
00:11:06,049 --> 00:11:12,538
Ni saa mbili za asubuhi, lakini chumba cha kujifunza kwenye chuo kimejaa. Hii ni nini?

177
00:11:12,562 --> 00:11:19,362
Kwa sababu likizo ya joto, watu wanakuja mapema asubuhi kujifunza.

178
00:11:19,385 --> 00:11:22,682
Wanafunzi wa mtihani wanajitahidi sana.

179
00:11:22,705 --> 00:11:26,315
Sisi tutasome wapi?

180
00:11:26,338 --> 00:11:29,971
Tufanyeje, twende maktaba karibu.

181
00:11:29,994 --> 00:11:34,034
Huko ni kimya na pengine kuna nafasi.

182
00:11:34,058 --> 00:11:36,143
Sawa.

183
00:11:36,166 --> 00:11:42,533
Wakati wa likizo ya joto, nyumbani kuna vishawishi vingi na sipati nafasi ya kujikaza.

184
00:11:42,556 --> 00:11:44,805
Naelewa.

185
00:11:44,828 --> 00:11:49,276
Nataka kuangalia televisheni na pia nataka kucheza michezo.

186
00:11:49,299 --> 00:11:55,366
Mazoezi ya likizo ya chuo, kuna madarasa matatu kila siku, naomba napata uchovu.

187
00:11:55,389 --> 00:12:01,956
Nakumbuka mwalimu alisema, 'Majira ya joto ni vita vya mtihani'.

188
00:12:01,979 --> 00:12:04,867
Neno 'tennouzan' linamaanisha nini?

189
00:12:04,891 --> 00:12:09,457
Linamaanisha ni wakati muhimu zaidi.

190
00:12:09,480 --> 00:12:13,373
Kama hatujitahidi sasa, hatutafaulu.

191
00:12:13,397 --> 00:12:15,632
Sawa.

192
00:12:15,656 --> 00:12:18,889
Umejiandaa kwa mtihani wa leo?

193
00:12:18,912 --> 00:12:24,979
Hapana, sijamaliza mazoezi ya jana, naomba nina wasiwasi kidogo.

194
00:12:25,002 --> 00:12:31,376
Basi, tutakapofika maktaba, tutasaidiana na sehemu ambazo hatuziwezi.

195
00:12:31,399 --> 00:12:33,067
Asante sana.

196
00:12:33,091 --> 00:12:38,491
Hasa fomula za hisabati, sijui kabisa na zinaniumiza.

197
00:12:38,514 --> 00:12:42,681
Kama ni hisabati, nitaweza kukufundisha.

198
00:12:42,704 --> 00:12:46,037
Badala yake, nipe mafunzo ya Kiingereza.

199
00:12:46,060 --> 00:12:47,545
Sawa.

200
00:12:47,569 --> 00:12:51,702
Nitakufundisha mbinu za kusoma maandishi marefu ya Kiingereza.

201
00:12:51,725 --> 00:12:53,459
Sawa basi.

202
00:12:53,482 --> 00:12:56,016
Basi, twende haraka maktaba.

203
00:12:56,039 --> 00:12:59,732
Kwa kutembea tu, tunatoa jasho.

204
00:12:59,756 --> 00:13:02,522
Joto sana kweli.

205
00:13:02,545 --> 00:13:06,236
Natamani tuingie chumba kinacho na mipasho ya baridi.

206
00:13:06,260 --> 00:13:10,137
Tukununue kununua kinywaji baridi kwenye duka la huduma ya saa nne kwanza.

207
00:13:10,161 --> 00:13:13,174
Ni muhimu kuziba upungufu wa maji.

208
00:13:13,197 --> 00:13:16,197
Mstari 7: Mpango wa Safari ya Likizo ya Majira ya Joto

209
00:13:16,197 --> 00:13:20,764
Mwaka huu wakati wa likizo ya majira ya joto, je, tutaenda safari popote?

210
00:13:20,787 --> 00:13:22,853
Sawa.

211
00:13:22,876 --> 00:13:29,610
Kwa sababu ni likizo ya kwanza ya majira ya joto tangu nikawa mwanafunzi wa chuo kikuu, nataka kwenda mbali kidogo.

212
00:13:29,633 --> 00:13:31,799
Hokkaido inaonekana nzuri, je?

213
00:13:31,822 --> 00:13:35,389
Nimesikia hata wakati wa majira ya joto, huko ni baridi.

214
00:13:35,412 --> 00:13:37,845
Hokkaido, basi.

215
00:13:37,868 --> 00:13:39,556
Sawa.

216
00:13:39,579 --> 00:13:43,388
Kuna vyakula vingi vya kupendeza pia.

217
00:13:43,412 --> 00:13:49,496
Tiketi za ndege, ikiwa hatutaziweka mapema zinaweza kuwa ghali.

218
00:13:49,520 --> 00:13:51,320
Ndiyo.

219
00:13:51,343 --> 00:13:59,556
Katikati ya mwezi wa Agosti ni ghali, basi mwishoni mwa Julai au mwanzo wa Septemba ni bora, nafikiri.

220
00:13:59,580 --> 00:14:02,913
Je, wiki ya mwisho ya Julai itakuwaje?

221
00:14:02,936 --> 00:14:05,936
Ni mara moja baada ya mtihani kukamilika.

222
00:14:05,960 --> 00:14:11,209
Kipindi hicho, tiketi zinaweza kuwa bado rahisi kununua.

223
00:14:11,232 --> 00:14:16,632
Tukiwa Hokkaido, tutaweka gari kwa ajili ya kutembea.

224
00:14:16,655 --> 00:14:22,857
Mimi nina leseni mpya tu, basi kuendesha gari kunanifanya nijisikie wasiwasi kidogo.

225
00:14:22,880 --> 00:14:25,514
Hakuna matata.

226
00:14:25,537 --> 00:14:31,737
Wanafunzi wenzangu wanasema barabara za Hokkaido ni pana na rahisi kuendeshea.

227
00:14:31,760 --> 00:14:34,395
Hiyo inanifanya nijisikie salama.

228
00:14:34,419 --> 00:14:38,552
Nataka kuona mashamba ya lavenda ya Furano.

229
00:14:38,575 --> 00:14:40,808
Yataonekana vizuri, nafikiri.

230
00:14:40,832 --> 00:14:45,565
Chakula cha jioni tutakula Genghis Khan (nyama ya kondoo) na ramen.

231
00:14:45,588 --> 00:14:48,990
Natamani sana kula donburi ya samaki.

232
00:14:49,013 --> 00:14:51,686
Sasa nina njaa.

233
00:14:51,710 --> 00:14:55,162
Je, tunahitaji bajeti ya kiasi gani?

234
00:14:55,186 --> 00:15:00,219
Ndege na hoteli zitakuwa takribani shilingi hamsini elfu.

235
00:15:00,242 --> 00:15:04,209
Lazima nipigie kazi kwa bidii ili nipate pesa.

236
00:15:04,232 --> 00:15:08,965
Mimi pia nina mpango wa kuongeza masaa yangu kwa kazi hii mwezi huu.

237
00:15:08,988 --> 00:15:14,156
Basi, leo usiku nitakutumia uteuzi wa hoteli kupitia LINE.

238
00:15:14,179 --> 00:15:15,913
Asante.

239
00:15:15,936 --> 00:15:18,508
Nitasubiri kwa hamu.

240
00:15:18,532 --> 00:15:21,532
Mstari 8: Ukweli wa Kufanya Kazi Kwenye Kioski ya Pwani

241
00:15:21,532 --> 00:15:25,765
Kazi ya likizo ya majira ya joto, umeamua tayari?

242
00:15:25,788 --> 00:15:27,355
Ndiyo.

243
00:15:27,379 --> 00:15:31,251
Nitafanya kazi kwenye kioski ya pwani.

244
00:15:31,275 --> 00:15:34,127
Ni kazi ya kukaa ndani.

245
00:15:34,150 --> 00:15:36,317
Hiyo ni nzuri.

246
00:15:36,340 --> 00:15:41,789
Kioski ya pwani kila siku unaweza kuona bahari, inaonekana ya kupendeza.

247
00:15:41,812 --> 00:15:48,979
Nami nilifikiria hivyo hivyo nikapostula, lakini kwa kweli inasemekana ni ngumu kidogo.

248
00:15:49,002 --> 00:15:51,935
Unafanya kazi gani?

249
00:15:51,958 --> 00:16:00,228
Inasemekana nitatengeneza chakula kwa wateja, kuuza barafu iliyochanganywa, na kukodisha miavuli.

250
00:16:00,251 --> 00:16:04,690
Unakaa nje kutoka asubuhi hadi jioni?

251
00:16:04,714 --> 00:16:08,533
Ndio.

252
00:16:08,556 --> 00:16:12,723
Kwa hiyo, kila siku ni joto sana na wanafunzi wenzangu wanasema kupata jua kali.

253
00:16:12,746 --> 00:16:17,027
Lakini pesa zinazopatikana ni nyingi, sivyo?

254
00:16:17,051 --> 00:16:18,617
Ndiyo.

255
00:16:18,640 --> 00:16:23,007
Nina mpango wa kupata takribani shilingi mia mbili kwa mwezi.

256
00:16:23,030 --> 00:16:26,075
Hiyo inanifanya nijisikie wivu.

257
00:16:26,099 --> 00:16:30,902
Mimi nitafanya kazi kwenye kafe karibu.

258
00:16:30,925 --> 00:16:35,059
Kafe pia ina mfumo wa kupoza hewa, inaonekana vizuri.

259
00:16:35,082 --> 00:16:42,891
Lakini wakati wa mchana ni shughuli nyingi sana na unakaa kusimama muda mrefu, kwa hiyo ni uchovu.

260
00:16:42,915 --> 00:16:48,648
Kila aina ya kazi ina changamoto zake.

261
00:16:48,671 --> 00:16:50,683
Sawa.

262
00:16:50,706 --> 00:16:55,078
Kazi ya vibanda vya pwani itaanza lini?

263
00:16:55,101 --> 00:16:59,068
Itaanza Jumatatu ijayo.

264
00:16:59,091 --> 00:17:03,499
Nitakusanya vitu vyangu na safari kesho.

265
00:17:03,522 --> 00:17:06,989
Jihadhari na afya yako na usifanye bidii sana.

266
00:17:07,013 --> 00:17:10,791
Ningojea kusikia hadithi za zawadi zako.

267
00:17:10,814 --> 00:17:12,547
Asante.

268
00:17:12,570 --> 00:17:16,374
Nitarudi nyeusi kama kaa kutokana na jua.

269
00:17:16,397 --> 00:17:19,197
Njoo ucheze kwenye kafe pia.

270
00:17:19,220 --> 00:17:23,288
Hakika, nitakuja siku ya pumziko.

271
00:17:23,312 --> 00:17:26,312
Mstari wa 9: Vita vya Kazi za Nyumbani za Mwisho wa Likizo ya Majira ya Joto

272
00:17:26,312 --> 00:17:34,650
Halo, tafadhali nisaidie, nipigie picha ukurasa wa thelathini na tano hadi mwisho wa kazi ya hisabati.

273
00:17:34,674 --> 00:17:35,807
Eh?

274
00:17:35,830 --> 00:17:39,964
Bado hujamaliza kazi yako ya nyumbani?

275
00:17:39,987 --> 00:17:44,443
Leo ni tarehe thelathini na moja Agosti.

276
00:17:44,466 --> 00:17:47,324
Sijamaliza kabisa.

277
00:17:47,347 --> 00:17:51,364
Pia, kuna karatasi za kanji zilizobaki kumi.

278
00:17:51,388 --> 00:17:54,882
Kila mwaka unafanya hivi vilevile.

279
00:17:54,905 --> 00:18:00,072
Likizo ilipoanza, uliweka mpango mzuri.

280
00:18:00,095 --> 00:18:07,353
Nilijitahidi kwa wiki ya kwanza, lakini baadaye nilikosa bidii.

281
00:18:07,376 --> 00:18:12,021
Mimi nilimaliza kila kitu wiki iliyopita.

282
00:18:12,044 --> 00:18:14,258
Haya, wewe ni mzuri sana.

283
00:18:14,282 --> 00:18:18,215
Tafadhali, nionyeshe majibu ya hisabati.

284
00:18:18,238 --> 00:18:20,679
Nakili tu, basi.

285
00:18:20,703 --> 00:18:25,381
Kukopi majibu pekee hakufai kama somo.

286
00:18:25,405 --> 00:18:29,038
Lazima nifanye hivyo ili nipone.

287
00:18:29,061 --> 00:18:33,794
Kesho nitapaswa kukabidhi, na mwalimu ataniadhibu sana.

288
00:18:33,817 --> 00:18:36,751
Sawa, basi.

289
00:18:36,774 --> 00:18:40,707
Sasa nitapiga picha na kukutumia.

290
00:18:40,730 --> 00:18:43,497
Asante sana. Umenisaidia sana.

291
00:18:43,520 --> 00:18:45,920
Unaonekana kama malaika.

292
00:18:45,943 --> 00:18:49,776
Badala yake, habari za shajara ya picha?

293
00:18:49,799 --> 00:18:52,199
Unakumbuka hali ya hewa?

294
00:18:52,222 --> 00:18:56,257
Sijui kabisa hali ya hewa.

295
00:18:56,281 --> 00:18:59,481
Labda nikaandike kuwa ilikuwa na jua.

296
00:18:59,504 --> 00:19:05,970
Unaweza kutafuta hali ya hewa ya zamani kwenye mtandao, andika kwa usahihi.

297
00:19:05,993 --> 00:19:09,435
Aa, hiyo ni njia nzuri.

298
00:19:09,459 --> 00:19:12,225
Sasa nitatafuta.

299
00:19:12,248 --> 00:19:14,782
Umaliza utafiti wa bure?

300
00:19:14,805 --> 00:19:21,772
Utafiti wa bure nilinunua seti ya kazi ya siku moja jana, nayo imemalizika.

301
00:19:21,795 --> 00:19:24,734
Umeitatua kwa pesa, basi.

302
00:19:24,758 --> 00:19:27,728
Eeh, kama umemaliza, basi ni sawa.

303
00:19:27,752 --> 00:19:31,752
Sawa, sasa nitajitahidi usiku kucha.

304
00:19:31,775 --> 00:19:36,245
Usikae usingizi ili usichelewe kesho.

305
00:19:36,268 --> 00:19:39,041
Sasa nitakutumia picha.

306
00:19:39,065 --> 00:19:42,065
Mstari wa 10: Maandalizi ya Muda Mpya wa Shule

307
00:19:42,065 --> 00:19:43,998
Habari ya asubuhi.

308
00:19:44,021 --> 00:19:46,316
Tumepatana kwa muda mrefu.

309
00:19:46,340 --> 00:19:49,033
Leo ni siku ya kwanza ya muda mpya wa shule.

310
00:19:49,056 --> 00:19:50,874
Habari ya asubuhi.

311
00:19:50,898 --> 00:19:55,132
Kuhusu kwenda shule, nina wasiwasi kidogo.

312
00:19:55,155 --> 00:19:58,088
Bado ninahisi usingizi.

313
00:19:58,111 --> 00:19:59,946
Subiri kidogo.

314
00:19:59,969 --> 00:20:03,903
Unavyofanya na nywele zako, je ziko salama?

315
00:20:03,926 --> 00:20:07,359
Bado ina rangi ya kahawia kidogo.

316
00:20:07,382 --> 00:20:09,849
Eeh, hatari!

317
00:20:09,872 --> 00:20:16,045
Nililichafua wakati wa likizo ya joto, na niliirekebisha kwa spreyi nyeusi ya nywele, lakini...

318
00:20:16,068 --> 00:20:25,468
Unapoangalia kwa mwanga, inaonekana kahawia sana. Mwalimu wa nidhamu yupo mbele ya lango la shule.

319
00:20:25,491 --> 00:20:27,625
Kweli kabisa.

320
00:20:27,648 --> 00:20:30,081
Ni Mwalimu Tanaka.

321
00:20:30,104 --> 00:20:33,737
Kama atatupata, atatukasirika sana.

322
00:20:33,760 --> 00:20:38,452
Atatuchukua mpaka ofisini na kutushauri.

323
00:20:38,476 --> 00:20:40,509
Tutafanyeje?

324
00:20:40,532 --> 00:20:45,466
Nitakwenda choo mara moja na kupulizia spreyi tena.

325
00:20:45,489 --> 00:20:49,855
Endelea upesi, maandamano ya mwanzo wa masomo yataanza.

326
00:20:49,878 --> 00:20:53,645
Urefu wa sketi yako, uko sawa?

327
00:20:53,668 --> 00:20:55,668
Haikufupishwa mno?

328
00:20:55,691 --> 00:21:00,458
Aa, nilifupisha wakati wa likizo ya joto.

329
00:21:00,481 --> 00:21:04,857
Nimeilowesha kwa ukanda tu, sasa nitairekebisha.

330
00:21:04,881 --> 00:21:09,447
Tunabaki na hisia za likizo bado, sivyo?

331
00:21:09,470 --> 00:21:11,470
Kweli.

332
00:21:11,493 --> 00:21:16,327
Shule ina sheria kali, tunapaswa kuzishika.

333
00:21:16,349 --> 00:21:19,816
Je, umechimba mashimo ya herini?

334
00:21:19,839 --> 00:21:26,172
Rafiki zangu wamechimba, lakini mimi niliogopa.

335
00:21:26,196 --> 00:21:28,429
Hiyo ni nzuri.

336
00:21:28,452 --> 00:21:32,097
Herini ni marufuku kabisa.

337
00:21:32,121 --> 00:21:35,521
Sawa, nimerudisha urefu wa sketi.

338
00:21:35,544 --> 00:21:38,435
Nywele zako zikoje?

339
00:21:38,458 --> 00:21:42,544
Nilitia maji chooni na kuzirekebisha kidogo.

340
00:21:42,568 --> 00:21:44,704
Hivi zitakuwa sawa?

341
00:21:44,728 --> 00:21:48,967
Ndiyo, zinaonekana nyeusi zaidi kuliko awali.

342
00:21:48,991 --> 00:21:52,357
Haraka, tutembee kwa kasi kupitia lango la shule.

343
00:21:52,380 --> 00:21:56,380
Tujaribu kutokutana na macho ya mwalimu.